27
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:56,800
as he and I crossed over from Cub Scouts,

28
00:01:56,800 --> 00:02:00,800
I took the plunge into the volcano immediately

29
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:03,800
and traded my Cub Master shirt for a Scout Master shirt.

30
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:06,800
I want to say thank you for all the great advice you've given out

31
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,800
